Subject: [PATCH] Add FastAPI automation system for VMAF testing with MongoDB
 integration

Implements a complete web-based automation platform for VMAF video quality testing:

API Features:
- FastAPI REST API with 8 endpoints for shows, episodes, and VMAF testing
- Background job processing for automated video transcoding and VMAF calculation
- Real-time job status tracking and progress monitoring
- MongoDB Atlas integration for storing test results and show metadata

Frontend:
- Interactive HTML/JavaScript web interface
- Search functionality across show titles, slugs, and descriptions
- One-click VMAF test execution for any episode
- Results visualization with quality ratings

VMAF Configuration:
- Uses vmaf_phone model optimized for mobile viewing (Chaishots app)
- Portrait video support (1080x1920, 720x1280, 480x854)
- Dual codec testing (H.264 and H.265)
- Configurable bitrate ladders for each resolution
- Automatic resolution scaling for accurate comparisons

Bitrate Optimizer:
- Service for finding optimal bitrate-quality balance
- GCS integration for cloud storage
- Automated transcoding pipeline with FFmpeg

Additional Tools:
- Batch comparison utilities for codec analysis
- M3U8 stream parser for HLS testing
- History tracking for VMAF calculations
- Comprehensive documentation and setup guides

Files:
- vmaf-api/: Complete FastAPI application with frontend
- vmaf_config.py: VMAF phone model configuration
- bitrate_optimizer/: Automated bitrate optimization service
- Documentation: Setup guides, API docs, and verification reports

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
