+    ↓
+    • show.title → Show names
+    • show.episodes[] → Episode list
+    • show.episodes[].s3_url → S3 URLs (PRIMARY)
+    ↓
+FastAPI Backend
+    ↓
+    • Queries MongoDB
+    • Validates data with Pydantic
+    • Returns JSON responses
+    ↓
+Frontend (HTML/JavaScript)
+    ↓
+    • Displays shows in dropdown
+    • Displays episodes in dropdown
+    • Shows S3 URL automatically
+    • Triggers VMAF tests
+    ↓
+Background Processing
+    ↓
+    • Downloads video from S3
+    • Runs 18 transcoding + VMAF tests
+    • Stores results in MongoDB
+```
