+## Troubleshooting
+
+### Error: FFmpeg not found
+```bash
+# Install FFmpeg
+brew install ffmpeg  # Mac
+sudo apt install ffmpeg  # Linux
+```
+
+### Error: VMAF tool not found
+```bash
+# Build VMAF tool
+cd /path/to/vmaf/libvmaf
+meson setup build --buildtype release
+ninja -C build
+```
+
+### Error: Video formats don't match
+The calculator automatically handles this by:
+1. Scaling distorted video to match reference resolution
+2. Converting both to Y4M format
+
+### Error: Out of disk space
+Y4M files are large (uncompressed). The calculator uses temp files and cleans them up, but ensure you have:
+- ~10GB free for 1080p video
+- ~40GB free for 4K video
+
+### Slow performance
+- Use `--threads` option to use more CPU cores
+- SSD storage helps with Y4M file I/O
+- Close other applications
